{
 "title": "Monomodule FX",
 "children": [
  {
   "title": "Overview",
   "lines": [
    "The Monomachine's",
    "seven FX machines as",
    "an audio effect on the",
    "audio in front of it."
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "Setup",
   "lines": [
    "Needs the Monomachine",
    "OS 1.32B file, a free",
    "download from",
    "Elektron: Elektron_SFX",
    "6-60_OS1.32B.syx.",
    "Upload it on this",
    "module's page in the",
    "web manager (one",
    "upload serves both",
    "Monomodule One and",
    "Monomodule FX).",
    "",
    "Optional: upload .syx",
    "kit dumps from a",
    "Monomachine to the",
    "'dumps' folder. Every",
    "sound in them appears",
    "in the Presets",
    "browser."
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "Pages",
   "lines": [
    "Presets: an Init for",
    "each FX machine, then",
    "the FX sounds of your",
    "dumps.",
    "",
    "Main: MACHN picks the",
    "effect, LEVEL the",
    "output level, LTNCY",
    "the blocks rendered",
    "ahead, LOAD the",
    "engine's CPU use.",
    "",
    "Then the effect's own",
    "page, AMP (its",
    "envelope stays open),",
    "FILT, EFX and LFO 1-3."
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "LFOs",
   "lines": [
    "PAGE picks which page",
    "the LFO modulates,",
    "DEST the control on",
    "it. With PAGE on SYNT",
    "the destinations are",
    "the current machine's",
    "own controls.",
    "",
    "TRIG: FREE runs",
    "freely, TRIG restarts",
    "on each note, HOLD",
    "samples, ONE plays one",
    "cycle, HALF half a",
    "cycle. MULT and SPD",
    "set the speed, INTL",
    "interlaces, DPTH is",
    "the depth."
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "Effects",
   "children": [
    {
     "title": "THRU",
     "lines": [
      "Passes the input",
      "through the track's",
      "AMP, FILT and EFX",
      "pages: use it to",
      "filter, distort or",
      "delay audio. INP sets",
      "the input gain."
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "REVERB",
     "lines": [
      "DEC decay, DAMP",
      "damping, GATE gate",
      "sensitivity, MIX",
      "dry/wet, HP and LP",
      "filter the reverb."
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "CHORUS",
     "lines": [
      "DEL delay, DEP depth,",
      "SPD speed, FB",
      "feedback, WID stereo",
      "width, LP low-pass."
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "DYNAMIX",
     "lines": [
      "A compressor: ATK,",
      "REL, THRS threshold,",
      "RAT ratio, GAIN makeup",
      "gain, RMS detection,",
      "MIX dry/wet."
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "RINGMOD",
     "lines": [
      "Ring-modulates the",
      "input with a waveform",
      "from sine to triangle",
      "(WAVE); EXT the amount",
      "of input, MIX dry/wet."
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "PHASER",
     "lines": [
      "CNTR centre, DEP",
      "depth, SPD speed, FB",
      "feedback, WID stereo",
      "width, MIX dry/wet."
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "FLANGER",
     "lines": [
      "DEL delay, DEP depth,",
      "SPD speed, FB",
      "feedback, WID stereo",
      "width, MIX dry/wet."
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "About",
   "lines": [
    "Monomodule runs the",
    "Monomachine's own",
    "sound engine inside an",
    "emulated DSP chip, so",
    "it is the hardware's",
    "sound, not an",
    "imitation. Monomodule",
    "is by shnolk",
    "(GPL-3.0); this is its",
    "Schwung port.",
    "",
    "Not affiliated with,",
    "endorsed by or",
    "sponsored by Elektron."
   ]
  }
 ]
}
